"{\"summary\": \"The diff adds `_line_part` in mcp.py, which locates a symbol's line via `location_part(root, entry[\\\"file_path\\\"], entry[\\\"line\\\"], entry[\\\"line\\\"])` only when the entry has both a file_path and a line, and `graph_parts` appends that located line after each entry's prose. It also adds `symbols_only` to `load_facts_file` and Java call-name helpers, but the line-locating code itself is the `_line_part`/`graph_parts` pair.\", \"ranges\": [[295, 334], [344, 361], [9, 30]]}"